      "title": "Latest \u2014 ${ticker:text}",
      "description": "The newest row for this fund, regardless of the time picker. Flow is money CREATED or REDEEMED, derived from assets rather than from the share count: the published share column is retroactively split-adjusted and rounds to thousands, which on the inverse funds puts 140 SQQQ rows at exactly 0.0 and fabricates up to 16x the real figure. 'Forced to trade' is (multiple^2 - multiple) x assets x 1%, the notional this fund MUST trade to hold its mandate after a 1% move in its index -- demand nobody chose, executed in swap and futures notional, and because assets are struck at the close it is what a move TOMORROW would force.",
